OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Media loads complete SD and internal libraries and keeps capacity visible during playback. Redesigned Multiview with a camera settings panel and cleaner Wi-Fi setup. Double-tap to track, joystick sizes, glass indicator pills and boxless tabs. Shutter angle stays fixed when FPS changes. Includes LEVEL, experimental Action 6 and lower CPU use. Fixes Live View crashes, video freezes, Nano zoom and clip deletion. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
